"P2094671588" "Field Test"
// DetailString :
"P742961021" "It all started when you agreed to field test a new Infected anti-serum. Upon your return Doctor Creed related that he discovered something rather important..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - InformantInfo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1561290733" "Arachnos Informant Info"
// DetailString :
"P1946707639" "The Arachnos Informant tells you that he's been doing guard duty at Fort Cerberus.  In a high-security area of the Fort is a secret laboratory where a scientist known as Doctor Geist is rumored to be performing biochemical experiments with the resulting effluence being pumped into the Mercy Island cesspools."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1316364946" "The Informant"
// DetailString :
"P2695063962" "It all started when you agreed to field test a new Infected anti-serum. Upon your return Doctor Creed related that he discovered something rather important&<br><br>An Arachnos informant had some information on the source of the cesspool contamination which creates the Infected, but the informant had been captured by Longbow before he could relate it. Doctor Creed gave you the location of the warehouse where Longbow was interrogating the informant, and you managed to break him out. The informant was an Arachnos guard at Fort Cerberus, and related how the there was some sort of biochemical project happening in a secret lab there led by a scientist known as Doctor Geist.  Doctor Creed was furious!  Geist was a former colleague of Creed who stole Creed's mutation theories for himself! Now Geist sold out to Arachnos, while Creed was struggling to survive in the Rogue Isles!  Doctor Creed swore vengeance..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeistResearchData 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2498464271" "Doctor Geist's Research Data"
// DetailString :
"P77720268" "Doctor Geist's research data contains all kinds of information on biochemical processes of  Arachnoids, some sort of human-spider mutant hybrid. Non-living specimens of these creatures were shipped to Fort Cerebus for further study from a place called Grandville."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SouvenirTestTube 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3487842812" "Doctor Geist's Test Tube"
// tDetailString :
"P3981843981" "This is a test tube taken from the lab of Doctor Geist, Arachnos scientist and rival of your contact Doctor Creed.  You obtained it in a story you like to call:<br><br><b>Weird Science</b><br><br>It all started when you agreed to field test a new Infected anti-serum. Upon your return Doctor Creed related that he discovered something rather important&<br><br>An Arachnos informant had some information on the source of the cesspool contamination which creates the Infected, but the informant had been captured by Longbow before he could relate it. Doctor Creed gave you the location of the warehouse where Longbow was interrogating the informant, and you managed to break him out. The informant was an Arachnos guard at Fort Cerberus, and related how the there was some sort of biochemical project happening in a secret lab there led by a scientist known as Doctor Geist.  Doctor Creed was furious!  Geist was a former colleague of Creed who stole Creed's mutation theories for himself! Now Geist sold out to Arachnos, while Creed was struggling to survive in the Rogue Isles!  Doctor Creed swore vengeance...<br><br>Doctor Creed sent you to break into Fort Cerebus to find Doctor Geist! Within the bowels of this Arachnos base you found the secret lab the informant spoke of, where strange experiments were being conducted. You defeated Doctor Geist and stole his research data, discovering how mutant human-spider hybrids called Arachnoids were being studied at the lab after being shipped there from a place known as Grandville. Doctor Creed was overjoyed with the defeat of this rival and the research information gained on the Arachnoids."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P439336440" "As a scientist, one must always have contingency plans in place in case something goes wrong. What's the point in creating an army of super-powered zombie-men when they can turn on you at any moment and rend you limb from limb? It's extremely counter-productive to any long-term goals of world domination!<br><br>As a part of risk mitigation I have developed a new Infected 'anti-serum' which causes the chemical equivalent of a chain reaction in an Infected, with some rather spectacular results! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go out and test the anti-serum on the Infected.</A> The least of the Infected are called the Stricken; they have the right bio-chemical balance to trigger the effect we're looking for."
// AcceptString :
"P2338436220" "Test Infected anti-serum"
// SendOffString :
"P2101747877" "You'll find the Infected wandering around the cesspools on Mercy Island. Now go off and test the Infected anti-serum!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2141882862" "I anxiously await the results of your field-testing the anti-serum!"

