// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2389506551" "So my old rival Doctor Geist sold out to Arachnos and is doing medical experiments for them, eh? And the waste from those experiments is ending up in the cesspools of Mercy and causing the Infected to come about? I must know more about those experiments! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break into Fort Cerberus and get the information out of Doctor Geist!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1758910067" "Interrogate Doctor Geist"
// SendOffString :
"P3698754012" "Make Doctor Geist pay for his treachery! Find what he knows so I may seize the knowledge for myself!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1141522547" "Defeat Geist, steal research"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3509754500" "What are you waiting for? Find out what that Arachnos lickboot Doctor Geist knows!"

